  },
  {
   "text": "and his desk is cleared.",
   "w0": 104,
   "w1": 108,
   "start": 35.247,
   "end": 36.311
  },
  {
   "text": "In Japan,",
   "w0": 109,
   "w1": 110,
   "start": 36.811,
   "end": 37.449
  },
  {
   "text": "firing someone",
   "w0": 111,
   "w1": 112,
   "start": 37.649,
   "end": 38.5
  },
  {
   "text": "without a strong reason",
   "w0": 113,
   "w1": 116,
   "start": 38.5,
   "end": 39.777
  },
  {
   "text": "is very hard.",
   "w0": 117,
   "w1": 119,
   "start": 39.777,
   "end": 40.628
  },
  {
   "text": "So some companies",
   "w0": 120,
   "w1": 122,
   "start": 41.128,
   "end": 42.191
  },
  {
   "text": "take away the work,",
   "w0": 123,
   "w1": 126,
   "start": 42.191,
   "end": 43.255
  },
  {
   "text": "and wait for you to leave.",
   "w0": 127,
   "w1": 132,
   "start": 43.455,
   "end": 44.732
  },
  {
   "text": "Japan calls them",
   "w0": 133,
   "w1": 135,
   "start": 45.232,
